### 3. Around 1440–1470: `weekCourseCount`, `teacherGroups`, and start of data loading

Teacher filtering in the **toolbar** is in the template block above (`weekViewTeacherId` / `visibleTeachers` for week overview, `teacherSearch` for day view). The **`teacherGroups`** computed only groups `courses.value` by `teacher_id` / `teacher_name`; it does not apply a teacher filter by itself.

```1451:1471:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/SmartCalendar.vue
const weekCourseCount = computed(() => filteredCourses.value.length);

// Teacher-grouped view
const teacherGroups = computed(() => {
  const map = {};
  courses.value.forEach(c => {
    const tid = c.teacher_id || 'unassigned';
    const tname = c.teacher_name || '未指派';
    if (!map[tid]) map[tid] = { teacher_id: tid, teacher_name: tname, courses: [], open: true };
    map[tid].courses.push(c);
  });
  // Sort courses within each group by day then time
  Object.values(map).forEach(g => {
    g.courses.sort((a, b) => (a.day_of_week - b.day_of_week) || (a.start_time || '').localeCompare(b.start_time || ''));
  });
  return Object.values(map).sort((a, b) => b.courses.length - a.courses.length);
});

